Bach M. Visual acuity “cheat sheet” for high and low vision [Internet]. Freiburg (Germany): Michael Bach; 2017 Oct 20 [updated 2026 Jun 11; cited 2026 Jun 13]. Available from: https://michaelbach.de/sci/acuity.html

